  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 2702.01 “Grant recipient” means “grant recipient” as defined in RSA 12-A:55, I, namely “the business entity that receives funds from the department and which provides funds to the training provider.”\n\nSource. #8975, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRED: 3-12-08\n\nNew. #9498, eff 7-1-09, EXPIRED: 7-1-17",
